e)</span></span></p></li><li dir="auto" aria-level="1" class="umaTK" style="margin-inline-start:1.5em;list-style-type:disc"><p class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="" id="viewer-4t5v022647" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><span>culpabilité quand on se repose</span></span></p><div class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="" id="viewer-vubox603" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><br role="presentation"></span></div></li></ul></div><div type="bulleted_list" data-hook="rcv-block9"></div><div><h4 class="ZaxVO X-Ect N9T8F EHFrS" dir="auto" id="viewer-01g7i22649" tabindex="-1"><span aria-hidden="true" id="ce-qui-entretient-la-surcharge-souvent-invisible-01g7i226"></span><span class="o457E"><span>Ce qui entretient la surcharge (souvent invisible)</span></span></h4></div><div type="heading" data-hook="rcv-block10"></div><div><div class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="auto" id="viewer-3z42o734" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><br role="presentation"></span></div></div><div type="empty-line" data-hook="rcv-block11"></div><div><p class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="auto" id="viewer-97m2722651" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><span>La surcharge augmente quand :</span></span></p></div><div type="paragraph" data-hook="rcv-block12"></div><div><ul class="tQIDd N9T8F"><li dir="auto" aria-level="1" class="umaTK" style="margin-inline-start:1.5em;list-style-type:disc"><p class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="" id="viewer-53o8c22655" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><span>vous portez seul(e) trop de sujets (logistique, affectif, anticipations)</span></span></p></li><li dir="auto" aria-level="1" class="umaTK" style="margin-inline-start:1.5em;list-style-type:disc"><p class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="" id="viewer-ekicb22658" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><span>vous dites oui trop vite, ou vous vous suradaptez</span></span></p></li><li dir="auto" aria-level="1" class="umaTK" style="margin-inline-start:1.5em;list-style-type:disc"><p class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="" id="viewer-0666e22661" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><span>vous visez “bien faire” partout (perfectionnisme)</span></span></p></li><li dir="auto" aria-level="1" class="umaTK" style="margin-inline-start:1.5em;list-style-type:disc"><p class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="" id="viewer-jqvyt22664" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><span>vous n’avez pas d’espace pour déposer ce qui vous traverse</span></span></p></li><li dir="auto" aria-level="1" class="umaTK" style="margin-inline-start:1.5em;list-style-type:disc"><p class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="" id="viewer-68dhp22667" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><span>vos limites ne sont pas claires (pour vous et pour les autres)</span></span></p></li></ul></div><div type="bulleted_list" data-hook="rcv-block13"></div><div><div class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="auto" id="viewer-lfoau22669" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><br role="presentation"></span></div></div><div type="empty-line" data-hook="rcv-block14"></div><div><h4 class="ZaxVO X-Ect N9T8F EHFrS" dir="auto" id="viewer-fyjsn784" tabindex="-1"><span aria-hidden="true" id="trois-actions-utiles-ds-cette-semaine-fyjsn784"></span><span class="o457E"><span>Trois actions utiles dès cette semaine</span></span></h4></div><div type="heading" data-hook="rcv-block15"></div><div><ol class="IzyC5 N9T8F"><li dir="auto" aria-level="1" class="umaTK" style="margin-inline-start:1.5em;list-style-type:decimal"><p class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="" id="viewer-watu122673" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><span>Fermer des “boucles”Une boucle ouverte = une micro-tension.Faites un inventaire brut: tout ce que vous portez (même “petit”). </span></span></p><p class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="" id="viewer-9boy01806" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><span>Puis classez :</span></span></p><p class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="" id="viewer-w7f2s22676" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><span>- à faire maintenant (vraiment)</span></span></p><p class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="" id="viewer-9ykty22679" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><span>- à planifier</span></span></p><p class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="" id="viewer-7fc2x22682" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><span>- à déléguer / demander</span></span></p><p class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="" id="viewer-5elex22685" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><span>- à arrêter</span></span></p><div class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="" id="viewer-fsp211905" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><br role="presentation"></span></div></li><li dir="auto" aria-level="1" class="umaTK" style="margin-inline-start:1.5em;list-style-type:decimal"><p class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="" id="viewer-lsadx22688" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><span>Revenir au corps (2 minutes, plusieurs fois)</span></span></p><p class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="" id="viewer-j7ble2647" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><span>La surcharge est autant physique que mentale. Deux repères simples : sentir vos appuis (pieds/siège) et allonger l’expiration. Cela remet du rythme.</span></span></p><div class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="" id="viewer-f8z5b2000" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><br role="presentation"></span></div></li><li dir="auto" aria-level="1" class="umaTK" style="margin-inline-start:1.5em;list-style-type:decimal"><p class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="" id="viewer-fhyf822691" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><span>Choisir une limite non négociable. Une seule.</span></span></p><p class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="" id="viewer-n4mso1181" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><span>Exemples :</span></span></p><p class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="" id="viewer-t4wa222694" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><span>pas de messages pro après 19h</span></span></p><p class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="" id="viewer-pfyui22697" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><span>une pause sans écran chaque jour</span></span></p><p class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="" id="viewer-r42sq22700" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><span>dire “je te réponds demain” au lieu de répondre dans l’urgence</span></span></p><p class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="" id="viewer-pm7ou1407" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><span>Une limite modeste mais tenue vaut mieux qu’un grand plan impossible.</span></span></p></li></ol></div><div type="ordered_list" data-hook="rcv-block16"></div><div><div class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="auto" id="viewer-o9qtt1589" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><br role="presentation"></span></div></div><div type="empty-line" data-hook="rcv-block17"></div><div><h5 class="L9GA7 X-Ect N9T8F EHFrS" dir="auto" id="viewer-vt3hn1680" tabindex="-1"><span aria-hidden="true" id="ce-que-la-gestalt-apporte-spcifiquement-vt3hn168"></span><span class="o457E"><span>Ce que la Gestalt apporte, spécifiquement</span></span></h5></div><div type="heading" data-hook="rcv-block18"></div><div><p class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="auto" id="viewer-01o6j2894" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><span>En Gestalt, la surcharge mentale est souvent reliée à un mode de fonctionnement : tenir, anticiper, ne pas décevoir, tout porter, ne pas déranger. Ce n’est pas “un défaut”, c’est souvent une stratégie ancienne pour rester en sécurité.</span></span></p></div><div type="paragraph" data-hook="rcv-block19"></div><div><div class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="auto" id="viewer-z3r2z22706" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><br role="presentation"></span></div></div><div type="empty-line" data-hook="rcv-block20"></div><div><p class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="auto" id="viewer-h434d3140" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><span>La Gestalt aide à :</span></span></p></div><div type="paragraph" data-hook="rcv-block21"></div><div><ul class="tQIDd N9T8F"><li dir="auto" aria-level="1" class="umaTK" style="margin-inline-start:1.5em;list-style-type:disc"><p class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="" id="viewer-xt7he22710" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><span>repérer le moment où vous vous quittez (là où vous dites oui alors que non)</span></span></p></li><li dir="auto" aria-level="1" class="umaTK" style="margin-inline-start:1.5em;list-style-type:disc"><p class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="" id="viewer-ctjkz22713" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><span>retrouver la capacité à sentir un besoin avant d’être au bout</span></span></p></li><li dir="auto" aria-level="1" class="umaTK" style="margin-inline-start:1.5em;list-style-type:disc"><p class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="" id="viewer-ekmmk22716" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><span>restaurer la frontière de contact : ce qui est à moi / ce qui n’est pas à moi</span></span></p></li><li dir="auto" aria-level="1" class="umaTK" style="margin-inline-start:1.5em;list-style-type:disc"><p class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="" id="viewer-qbjv222719" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><span>expérimenter des ajustements concrets : demander, déléguer, dire non, ralentir</span></span></p></li></ul></div><div type="bulleted_list" data-hook="rcv-block22"></div><div><div class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="auto" id="viewer-z8csa22721" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><br role="presentation"></span></div></div><div type="empty-line" data-hook="rcv-block23"></div><div><p class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="auto" id="viewer-7a8y73096" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><span>On travaille avec des situations réelles de votre quotidien, et on observe ensemble ce qui se passe dans votre corps et dans la relation quand vous posez une limite. C’est souvent là que tout change.</span></span></p></div><div type="paragraph" data-hook="rcv-block24"></div><div><div class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="auto" id="viewer-7oux03048" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><br role="presentation"></span></div></div><div type="empty-line" data-hook="rcv-block25"></div><div><p class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="auto" id="viewer-a4yxi22723" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><span>Quand consulter</span></span></p></div><div type="paragraph" data-hook="rcv-block26"></div><div><ul class="tQIDd N9T8F"><li dir="auto" aria-level="1" class="umaTK" style="margin-inline-start:1.5em;list-style-type:disc"><p class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="" id="viewer-62jno22727" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><span>si vous êtes en tension constante, même quand “tout va bien”</span></span></p></li><li dir="auto" aria-level="1" class="umaTK" style="margin-inline-start:1.5em;list-style-type:disc"><p class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="" id="viewer-a9wku22730" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><span>si vous vous sentez au bord de l’épuisement</span></span></p></li><li dir="auto" aria-level="1" class="umaTK" style="margin-inline-start:1.5em;list-style-type:disc"><p class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="" id="viewer-6qmuv22733" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><span>si votre vie intérieure est saturée et que vous n’avez plus d’espace pour vous</span></span></p></li></ul></div><div type="bulleted_list" data-hook="rcv-block27"></div><div><div class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="auto" id="viewer-4myks22735" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><br role="presentation"></span></div></div><div type="empty-line" data-hook="rcv-block28"></div><div><h4 class="ZaxVO X-Ect N9T8F EHFrS" dir="auto" id="viewer-p0ww53199" tabindex="-1"><span aria-hidden="true" id="accompagnement-tours-ou-en-visio-p0ww5319"></span><span class="o457E"><span>Accompagnement à Tours ou en visio</span></span></h4></div><div type="heading" data-hook="rcv-block29"></div><div><p class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="auto" id="viewer-avpyx22737" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><span>Je vous reçois en cabinet à Tours ou en visio. </span></span></p></div><div type="paragraph" data-hook="rcv-block30"></div><div><p class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="auto" id="viewer-8nuwe3298" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><span>Séance : 45 minutes - 70 €.</span></span></p></div><div type="paragraph" data-hook="rcv-block31"></div><div><p class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="auto" id="viewer-7i8p53545" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><span>Annulation : prévenir 24 heures à l’avance.</span></span></p></div><div type="paragraph" data-hook="rcv-block32"></div><div><div class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="auto" id="viewer-hgpuk3597" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><br role="presentation"></span></div></div><div type="empty-line" data-hook="rcv-block33"></div><div><p class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="auto" id="viewer-tjxer22739" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><span>Prendre rendez-vousTéléphone </span></span></p></div><div type="paragraph" data-hook="rcv-block34"></div><div><p class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="auto" id="viewer-owdug3749" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><span>06 52 14 74 36</span></span></p></div><div type="paragraph" data-hook="rcv-block35"></div><div><p class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="auto" id="viewer-fmght4006" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><span>Email : </span><a target="_blank" href="mailto:elisa@gatay.fr" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="kmSaa SKaQD" data-hook="web-link"><u style="text-decoration:underline"><span>elisa@gatay.fr</span></u></a></span></p></div><div type="paragraph" data-hook="rcv-block36"></div><div><div class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="auto" id="viewer-6kcgp22742" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><br role="presentation"></span></div></div><div type="empty-line" data-hook="rcv-block37"></div><div><div class="z1iSk xmP9V N9T8F EHFrS" dir="auto" id="viewer-y1fra4113" tabindex="-1"><span class="yPyHp"><br role="presentation"></span></div></div><div type="empty-line" data-hook="rcv-block38"></div><div><div class="JRr-4" id="viewer-54c0l4249" tabindex="-1"><div class="_2z3uq fI6L4"><a class="_7mb6t" style="print-color-adjust:exact" data-hook="button-viewer button-viewer-54c0l4249" tabindex="0" href="/post/poser-ses-limites-arrêter-de-s-adapter-au-prix-de-soi/" target="_blank"><div class="_3RHNV">Lire d'autres articles en lien</div></a></div></div></div><div type="button" data-hook="rcv-block39"></div><div><div class